UHV

Purpose

UHV is the ninth major electrical tier of the progression.

This stage represents the extreme end of conventional industrial technology.

UHV requires enormous energy production, extremely advanced materials, highly complex processing chains, massive automation, and a fully developed industrial infrastructure.

The objective of UHV is to represent the final conventional technological tier before the post-endgame.

