Power

UHV represents the highest conventional power requirements.

Power generation must operate at enormous industrial capacity.

Electrical distribution must support large numbers of extreme-consumption machines operating simultaneously.

Power networks must be designed for entire industrial complexes rather than individual production lines.

Energy storage and stabilization become critical.

The power infrastructure must be capable of supporting post-endgame technology.

