Modern Industrialization Integration

Modern Industrialization acts as a complementary industrial system.

MI can provide additional machinery and processing capabilities for UHV production.

MI systems must follow the established UHV progression.

MI must not provide an alternative route that bypasses the main technological progression.

Mekanism Integration

Mekanism provides advanced chemical processing, refining, energy systems, and industrial utilities.

Its systems can support the enormous scale of UHV infrastructure.

Mekanism materials and machines must remain integrated with the main progression.

Mekanism must not provide access to post-endgame technology before the required progression is completed.

