Exit Condition

UHV is completed when the player has established an enormous and highly automated industrial complex.

UHV production must be extensively automated.

Major UHV materials must have reliable production.

Important UHV components must be produced automatically.

Advanced chemical and material processing must be fully integrated.

Power generation and distribution must support continuous UHV production.

The industrial complex must be capable of operating many extreme-consumption machines simultaneously.

The player must be able to produce the materials and components required to begin post-endgame progression.

After these requirements are fulfilled, post-endgame progression is unlocked.

The ultimate goal of UHV is to complete the conventional technological progression and provide the industrial foundation for the final progression of the pack.
